            "review_title": "Review at Sun Ocean Cafe & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Alan R\nWest Palm Beach, Florida41 contributions\n0\nInconsistent\nSep 2016 • Couples\nThis restaurant offers excellent atmosphere and above average food. Unfortunately the service is poor. Management allows servers to ignore customers while employees are busy looking at their smartphones watching videos and using social media. The unacceptable restrooms are poorly maintained. Servers speak little to no English. We ate here twice and one of the dishes came out completely different the second time and took so long that my partner's meal was cold before it arrived. \nBecause the negative outweighs the positive, I do not recommend this restaurant. I will not return. Many better selections in Danang.\nRead more\nWritten September 26, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
