            "review_title": "Review at Sun Ocean Cafe & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "519h_v\n2 contributions\n0\nDisappointed and unsatisfied place\nJun 2016 • Family\nSo I came back to this restaurant after a long time for breakfast. Following to my remember, it used to be a good restaurant with acceptable price and nice view, the service sometimes stayed up for a little bit longer, but I felt okay with it. But this time was a horrible experience. My parents' order was completely wrong, and my ham was still frozen. When we complain about it to a staff, after listening he walked straight away without saying a word. He could not help but at least he could tell other staff to change my parents' meal. And of course, he did not. So we had another to let them know, and you know what he said? He said due to the crowded of this restaurant right now, he can do nothing. It was ridiculous, the basic service skill is satisfied your customer and this restaurant can not even do that! Our entire Sunday morning was ruined because of that. We just had to pay 400.000 VND for this meal, not a big money but they made us feel unworthy\nRead more\nWritten June 29, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
