            "review_text": "Fru A\n4 contributions\n0\nLunch\nMar 2016 • Couples\nWe stayed in Da Nang for 4 weeks, and go back to Sun Ocean for lunch over and over again! It's our favorite place for lunch, so comfortable chairs in that nice garden, delicious food, not too overactive staff....they let you eat without standing by looking at you!! The prices is good, you will be filled up for 8USD... Try their Beef salad, it's just wonderful!! And also several other dishes is recommendable. Little bit out of the city center, but go there and try it.\nRead more\nWritten March 21, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
